---
---

<div id="about" class="min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 py-16 relative overflow-hidden">
	<!-- Efectos de fondo -->
	<div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/3 w-80 h-80 bg-green-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl animate-pulse"></div>
	<div class="absolute bottom-1/4 right-1/3 w-64 h-64 bg-green-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl animate-pulse delay-500"></div>
	
	<h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-7xl md:text-9xl font-bold text-green-500 text-center mb-16 about-title relative z-10">
		About Me
	</h1>
	
	<div class="max-w-4xl w-full relative z-10">
		<div class="about-content backdrop-blur-lg bg-white/5 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 border border-green-500/30 hover:border-green-500/50 transition-all duration-500 relative overflow-hidden group">
			<!-- Efecto de brillo -->
			<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-500/0 via-green-500/10 to-green-500/0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700"></div>
			
			<div class="relative z-10 space-y-6">
				<div class="about-paragraph backdrop-blur-sm bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-green-500/20 hover:border-green-500/40 transition-all duration-300">
					<p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed">
						I'm a passionate Full Stack Developer from Medellín, Colombia, with a strong focus on creating elegant and efficient web solutions. My journey in software development has been driven by curiosity and a constant desire to learn new technologies.
					</p>
				</div>
				
				<div class="about-paragraph backdrop-blur-sm bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-green-500/20 hover:border-green-500/40 transition-all duration-300">
					<p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed">
						I specialize in modern web technologies including React, Astro, and Tailwind CSS. I enjoy building responsive, user-friendly applications that solve real-world problems. My approach combines clean code practices with creative problem-solving.
					</p>
				</div>
				
				<div class="about-paragraph backdrop-blur-sm bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-green-500/20 hover:border-green-500/40 transition-all duration-300">
					<p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed">
						When I'm not coding, you can find me exploring new technologies, contributing to open-source projects, or working on personal projects that challenge my skills and expand my knowledge.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>